# Paths that define or enforce the trust rules require a repository owner's
# review, separate from any content review in the same pull request.
#
# Rationale: docs/security-model.md threat T6 — the natural attack is one pull
# request that adds a payload and relaxes the rule that would have caught it.
#
# CODEOWNERS only takes effect once branch protection on the default branch has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled; the file alone enforces nothing.

/schema/                  @oritromax
/lint/                    @oritromax
/build/                   @oritromax
/test/                    @oritromax
/.github/                 @oritromax
/CODEOWNERS               @oritromax
/.github/CODEOWNERS       @oritromax
/SPEC.md                  @oritromax
/CONTRIBUTING.md          @oritromax
/docs/security-model.md   @oritromax
/package.json             @oritromax
/package-lock.json        @oritromax
